                "charID": "aida",
                "type": "spoken",
                "charName": "aida",
                "text": "Some behavioral and relational considerations are behavioral equivalence, cognitive equivalence, social valence, social relations, potentiality, and class membership. Which do you want to discuss?"
            }
        ],
        "choice": [
